From c7d56661f0f842b7ac5136c88697ca4c2790a02e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robert DeLanghe <1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:35:41 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix(convo): every source reader builds delegations from
 delegation-type tool calls (pr/64)

ToolInvocation::as_delegation is the one function; cursor, opencode and codex
now use it, claude and gemini drop their copies, gemini categorises invoke_agent.
Snapshots and graph-01-release.json re-recorded and reviewed. The copilot->codex
roundtrip pin needs capture in the nix dev shell (see the record).
